        book: Path, extra_spaces: int
    ) -> None:
        """The number of the real desk stand-in, then ASCII spaces so that the 67 byte read ends between two characters
        for any digit count of the number, then ideographic spaces up to 90 bytes: stale at any digit count, so the desk
        keeps running and the pid file is deleted (extra_spaces shifts the cut by one or two bytes)."""
        _utf8_bash()
